Bug Resolution & Verification Reports
EXECUTIVE SUMMARY
This document details the architectural solutions, logic repairs, and verification test outcomes for Bug 10 , Bug 11 , and Bug 12 identified during the system audit.
Bug 10 Resolution (features/prompt-manager.js): Repaired updateVariant content handling to prevent unintended payload clearing and ensured first-install default prompt persistence to local browser storage.
Bug 11 Resolution (features/zip-processor.js): Centralized path sanitization into a strict segment parsing engine (sanitizePathParts), eliminating parent directory traversal (..), dot-only folder segments (.), and trailing/padded whitespace anomalies across all ingestion modes.
Bug 12 Resolution (content.js): Synchronized the staging matrix master toggle state (masterToggle) with search filtering (stagingSearch) and individual checkbox actions, adding indeterminate state detection (masterToggle.indeterminate) for partial selections.
